There's a certain satisfaction from doing it in the right order.

2241
02:52:07,840 --> 02:52:11,160
A Seizel run is always good, because a Seizel is good, you know?

2242
02:52:17,130 --> 02:52:18,510
Like, what is going on with that?

2243
02:52:21,680 --> 02:52:26,160
I mean, I know there's not a right order, but there is an order from one and then down, right?

2244
02:52:26,980 --> 02:52:29,780
So there is an order, and I like following that, that's all.

2245
02:52:36,200 --> 02:52:37,320
Yeah, this one is crazy.

2246
02:52:39,340 --> 02:52:43,160
I'll do one last, but it's not going to be a challenge, because I've had it with the challenges.

2247
02:52:46,920 --> 02:52:49,060
I just had to bend a little bit there to you guys.

2248
02:52:52,120 --> 02:52:53,680
I just had to bend a little bit.

2249
02:52:55,900 --> 02:52:56,440
One more.

2250
02:52:57,560 --> 02:52:59,220
We're going to do random.

2251
02:53:04,390 --> 02:53:05,050
What's it going to be?

2252
02:53:06,230 --> 02:53:07,490
Okay, I like that, actually.

2253
02:53:09,110 --> 02:53:10,050
That's very different.

2254
02:53:10,590 --> 02:53:11,370
I'm happy about that.

2255
02:53:16,290 --> 02:53:17,270
He's going to do diagonal.

2256
02:53:17,770 --> 02:53:18,750
Oh, never mind, he's doing bombs.

2257
02:53:25,500 --> 02:53:27,120
I got to rewire my brain real quick here.

2258
02:53:38,830 --> 02:53:39,670
Oh, man!

2259
02:53:41,310 --> 02:53:45,050
I thought that bomb was going to come flying towards me there at the end.

2260
02:53:47,050 --> 02:53:47,850
And I got to jump.

2261
02:53:53,960 --> 02:53:54,700
And jump.

2262
02:53:59,640 --> 02:54:01,720
God, it feels good to shoot projectiles again.

2263
02:54:10,900 --> 02:54:14,460
I mean, it lets me get in here.

2264
02:54:19,950 --> 02:54:21,050
This is a great start.

2265
02:54:35,150 --> 02:54:38,630
I kind of want to go back and do the darkness challenge again now.

2266
02:54:39,210 --> 02:54:41,470
Just to cleanse my body after that.

2267
02:54:42,990 --> 02:54:44,090
Ah, look at this!

2268
02:54:45,350 --> 02:54:46,790
We got tinted rocks again.

2269
02:54:46,930 --> 02:54:49,310
I think we can confirm there's no tinted rocks and challenges.

2270
02:54:49,910 --> 02:54:52,890
Because there's just no way that I would have missed them all this time.

2271
02:54:56,070 --> 02:54:56,770
Bogo bombs.

2272
02:54:57,510 --> 02:55:00,210
All bomb pickups become... That is a synergy with what I have.

2273
02:55:01,910 --> 02:55:04,270
But do I want to become a bomb slinging bastard?

2274
02:55:05,370 --> 02:55:06,210
That's the question.

2275
02:55:06,450 --> 02:55:07,290
We need to ask ourselves.

2276
02:55:09,490 --> 02:55:11,190
Should I let the bombs into my heart?

2277
02:55:13,370 --> 02:55:14,430
Or do I reject them?

2278
02:55:21,820 --> 02:55:22,000
Nice.

2279
02:55:23,820 --> 02:55:26,660
Actually, we got to kill those little bottom dwellers here.

2280
02:55:28,720 --> 02:55:29,780
Otherwise, they keep spawning those guys.

2281
02:55:37,060 --> 02:55:41,440
Okay, so on this character, I think I need more hearts for sure.

2282
02:55:42,940 --> 02:55:44,140
But not too many.

2283
02:55:44,400 --> 02:55:45,300
Just a little bit, you know?

2284
02:55:46,120 --> 02:55:48,340
And then it's all about damage and familiars.

2285
02:55:49,520 --> 02:55:49,920
Whoa!

2286
02:55:51,040 --> 02:55:51,820
Good combo.

2287
02:55:58,910 --> 02:55:59,630
Oh, wait a minute.

2288
02:56:00,070 --> 02:56:00,730
Jage is at my feet.

2289
02:56:01,030 --> 02:56:01,410
One minute.

2290
02:56:48,620 --> 02:56:50,440
I gave her some early dinner.

2291
02:56:51,560 --> 02:56:53,840
She's also obsessed with something outside the window right now.

2292
02:56:56,820 --> 02:56:59,960
So much, in fact, that she didn't immediately go to the food, which was interesting.

2293
02:57:05,090 --> 02:57:06,230
Okay, this one's going to take a bit.

2294
02:57:09,050 --> 02:57:09,990
Oh, no way.

2295
02:57:12,030 --> 02:57:13,570
I can't afford those mistakes.

2296
02:57:24,900 --> 02:57:25,200
Nice.

2297
02:57:28,880 --> 02:57:30,360
Yeah, he's healing on those.

2298
02:57:36,870 --> 02:57:37,970
Actually, it's not that bad.

2299
02:57:38,590 --> 02:57:40,550
I keep thinking stats don't matter for me, but they do.

2300
02:57:40,910 --> 02:57:42,430
This is no longer the solar system.

2301
02:57:49,560 --> 02:57:51,620
Dude, damage matters, tears, and...

2302
02:57:51,620 --> 02:57:52,480
Oh, everything matters again.

2303
02:57:56,040 --> 02:57:57,660
Finding upgrades is going to feel good.

2304
02:57:59,180 --> 02:58:00,260
Okay, we're actually going to...

2305
02:58:03,000 --> 02:58:03,780
Oh, man.

2306
02:58:10,240 --> 02:58:10,920
Yeah, come on, then.

2307
02:58:25,560 --> 02:58:34,260
In fact, I think, theoretically, this character could be one of the characters that do the most damage, simply because you can pretty much double your damage at any time, right?

2308
02:58:35,660 --> 02:58:37,340
Assuming you hit with all your tiles.

2309
02:58:38,400 --> 02:58:39,440
Should I keep going in there?

2310
02:58:40,060 --> 02:58:40,420
I think so.

2311
02:58:46,020 --> 02:58:46,500
Cute pen.

2312
02:58:47,520 --> 02:58:48,540
Chance to fire a slowing shot.

2313
02:58:48,980 --> 02:58:49,540
That's nice.

2314
02:58:54,430 --> 02:58:55,530
I like slowing down people.

2315
02:59:03,900 --> 02:59:10,720
I will say the shops in this game are extremely underwhelming, compared to other roguelikes with shops, you know?

2316
02:59:11,860 --> 02:59:15,180
It's like the most underwhelming place to get items, in my opinion.

2317
02:59:16,640 --> 02:59:18,900
The most exciting being devils and angels, right?

2318
02:59:20,380 --> 02:59:23,540
Treasure rooms after that, then shops is pretty much the lowest of the low.

2319
02:59:29,330 --> 02:59:29,630
Great.

2320
02:59:30,950 --> 02:59:31,290
Thanks.

2321
02:59:41,820 --> 02:59:42,900
I don't trust myself.

2322
02:59:43,020 --> 02:59:43,900
I'm going to run into that fire.

2323
02:59:45,480 --> 02:59:46,100
So did he!

2324
02:59:49,110 --> 02:59:50,130
Makes me feel better.

2325
03:00:07,080 --> 03:00:12,540
I want to get to the flooded area, just because of the music and the ambiance.

2326
03:00:13,620 --> 03:00:14,860
I haven't seen it in 10 years.

2327
03:00:19,590 --> 03:00:20,990
That was kind of advanced dodging there.

2328
03:00:21,610 --> 03:00:24,490
A little bit risky, but it paid off.

2329
03:00:30,030 --> 03:00:31,470
I think we just go for it.

2330
03:00:33,010 --> 03:00:34,050
Still a treasure room missing.

2331
03:00:46,810 --> 03:00:48,970
Please HP, please HP, HP, HP.

2332
03:00:50,970 --> 03:00:51,350
Good.

2333
03:00:53,530 --> 03:00:54,290
Am I...

2334
03:00:54,290 --> 03:00:55,510
Oh, very nice.

2335
03:00:55,890 --> 03:00:57,470
Okay, that means I can pretty much take one of these.

2336
03:01:00,090 --> 03:01:00,150
Haha.

2337
03:01:00,950 --> 03:01:02,670
I sell my soul for money?

2338
03:01:02,830 --> 03:01:03,550
I don't think so.

2339
03:01:04,810 --> 03:01:06,610
Familia that fires spectral tears.

2340
03:01:07,050 --> 03:01:07,910
That's good for me.

2341
03:01:09,250 --> 03:01:12,690
So that means I can get four creatures when I use my active, right?

2342
03:01:13,630 --> 03:01:15,250
That's an active, so we don't want that.

2343
03:01:15,410 --> 03:01:15,810
I take this.

2344
03:01:18,630 --> 03:01:19,910
Let's go find the treasure room.

2345
03:01:23,330 --> 03:01:24,490
Oh, this is going to be so good.

2346
03:01:25,970 --> 03:01:27,090
I got five bombs as well.

2347
03:01:27,230 --> 03:01:28,650
I could go bomb some shit.

2348
03:01:30,010 --> 03:01:31,110
Let me check the other sides first.

2349
03:01:34,390 --> 03:01:36,150
See, there's rocks here, right?

2350
03:01:37,210 --> 03:01:40,090
So, imagine you were inside the secret room blowing up the wall.

2351
03:01:40,870 --> 03:01:43,410
You're not going to walk into a rock, so I know that's not a secret room.

2352
03:01:49,190 --> 03:01:50,230
Oh no, oh no.

2353
03:01:50,690 --> 03:01:51,310
I'm scared.

2354
03:01:52,350 --> 03:01:52,990
I'm actually gonna duplicate.

2355
03:01:53,950 --> 03:01:54,770
Look at that damage!

2356
03:01:56,630 --> 03:01:57,350
So many tears.

2357
03:02:00,030 --> 03:02:00,550
Ohoy!

2358
03:02:01,430 --> 03:02:02,670
The ultimate drive-by.

2359
03:02:03,510 --> 03:02:04,270
Here comes the train.

2360
03:02:05,330 --> 03:02:06,090
Beep, beep, beep.

2361
03:02:07,890 --> 03:02:08,270
Amazing.

2362
03:02:22,340 --> 03:02:23,140
It's not nice.

2363
03:02:31,060 --> 03:02:32,720
Treasure room should be, well, here.

2364
03:02:44,810 --> 03:02:46,610
And finding that little familiar is actually huge.

2365
03:02:50,320 --> 03:02:51,040
No way!

2366
03:02:54,480 --> 03:02:55,620
Walk into my shots.

2367
03:02:59,060 --> 03:03:00,120
I can't die here.

2368
03:03:07,280 --> 03:03:08,860
Okay, here we go.

2369
03:03:11,060 --> 03:03:13,260
Launches... oh no, it's an active.

2370
03:03:15,560 --> 03:03:17,020
I don't want it.

2371
03:03:19,280 --> 03:03:19,680
No.

2372
03:03:26,630 --> 03:03:27,410
Okay, that's good.

2373
03:03:29,010 --> 03:03:30,410
I'll give you a couple of bombs.

2374
03:03:30,670 --> 03:03:30,910
Why not?

2375
03:03:32,970 --> 03:03:33,370
Ha!

2376
03:03:35,090 --> 03:03:37,050
Didn't I also get other bomb effects on this guy?

2377
03:03:37,270 --> 03:03:38,070
Yeah, bop's curse.

2378
03:03:39,910 --> 03:03:41,190
I guess we embraced the bomb.

2379
03:03:41,370 --> 03:03:42,290
We let it into our hearts.

2380
03:03:44,570 --> 03:03:45,730
Maybe I shouldn't be gambling now.

2381
03:03:45,830 --> 03:03:46,470
Yeah, this is a bad idea.

2382
03:03:47,030 --> 03:03:50,330
Let's just blow some shit up.

2383
03:03:53,960 --> 03:03:55,180
Oh, nice.

2384
03:03:56,320 --> 03:03:57,980
We're gonna grab the eternal heart and get out.

2385
03:04:03,120 --> 03:04:04,200
This is a good start.

2386
03:04:12,720 --> 03:04:13,880
I could be looking for secrets.

2387
03:04:16,220 --> 03:04:16,640
Maybe here.

2388
03:04:27,120 --> 03:04:28,120
There we go.

2389
03:04:31,800 --> 03:04:32,860
How nice is that?

2390
03:04:40,800 --> 03:04:41,040
Yikes!

2391
03:04:44,490 --> 03:04:45,450
Super start!

2392
03:04:50,580 --> 03:04:52,340
Dude, let's kind of do a speed run here.

2393
03:04:52,680 --> 03:04:53,800
Like, semi-speed run.

2394
03:04:55,180 --> 03:04:57,420
We're not gonna go super hard, but we're gonna go hard, you know?

2395
03:05:11,450 --> 03:05:12,190
Here we go.

2396
03:05:17,170 --> 03:05:18,870
I could go in there, but I'm not gonna.

2397
03:05:29,460 --> 03:05:30,480
I don't know what just happened.

2398
03:05:36,200 --> 03:05:36,860
Why not?

2399
03:05:38,260 --> 03:05:38,880
I'll bite.

2400
03:05:41,160 --> 03:05:42,400
Hey, okay.

2401
03:05:51,740 --> 03:05:53,820
Slow, slow, slow, and then go the other way.

2402
03:05:56,720 --> 03:05:57,540
Look at that stutter step.

2403
03:05:58,740 --> 03:05:59,700
Advanced strategies here.

2404
03:06:05,620 --> 03:06:06,540
That's pretty good, huh?

2405
03:06:09,100 --> 03:06:10,140
Hey, actually.

2406
03:06:22,000 --> 03:06:22,660
That was scary.

2407
03:06:25,320 --> 03:06:26,060
What is that?

2408
03:06:30,120 --> 03:06:31,360
Dude, how do you dodge that?

2409
03:06:33,080 --> 03:06:33,900
Spider baby.

2410
03:06:35,720 --> 03:06:37,220
What does that actually do?

2411
03:06:43,690 --> 03:06:43,830
Sucks.

2412
03:06:53,700 --> 03:06:54,400
I need a converter.

2413
03:06:57,220 --> 03:06:59,740
That's what's gonna save this even more.

2414
03:07:05,980 --> 03:07:08,000
Ah, then again, then I can't use my little box, actually.

2415
03:07:08,340 --> 03:07:10,500
Maybe it's not the best in this case.

2416
03:07:27,100 --> 03:07:28,200
Ah, this is not the one.

2417
03:07:28,280 --> 03:07:28,960
This is the shitty one.

2418
03:07:30,000 --> 03:07:31,300
Dude, don't be fooled.

2419
03:07:33,220 --> 03:07:33,960
Not like last time.

2420
03:07:34,560 --> 03:07:36,180
Oh, I could donate some money, I guess.

2421
03:07:36,380 --> 03:07:36,820
Why, you know what?

2422
03:07:36,920 --> 03:07:37,160
Why not?

2423
03:07:38,440 --> 03:07:39,260
Throw it all in there.

2424
03:07:41,980 --> 03:07:43,360
We got to start donating to that.

2425
03:07:43,500 --> 03:07:44,920
I want to see what happens when we get to 500.

2426
03:07:46,440 --> 03:07:47,440
Maybe even a thousand.

2427
03:07:48,340 --> 03:07:48,620
Who knows?

2428
03:07:51,200 --> 03:07:56,160
Speaking of donations, we should do greed again and donate to the donation machine at the end.

2429
03:07:58,180 --> 03:08:01,060
That definitely unlocked a lot of shit last time.

2430
03:08:08,270 --> 03:08:08,750
Okay.

2431
03:08:09,970 --> 03:08:11,610
I will say, though, I need more health.

2432
03:08:13,210 --> 03:08:15,870
I'm once again asking for more health.

2433
03:08:23,680 --> 03:08:24,460
I'm gonna go in.

2434
03:08:26,360 --> 03:08:27,760
I feel it.

2435
03:08:28,540 --> 03:08:30,080
I'm gonna duplicate and go nuts.

2436
03:08:31,660 --> 03:08:32,940
He's gonna charge me at some point.

2437
03:08:33,380 --> 03:08:33,900
There he comes.

2438
03:08:39,830 --> 03:08:40,550
Oh, god.

2439
03:08:40,970 --> 03:08:42,110
Oh, god, man!

2440
03:08:43,930 --> 03:08:44,450
Yes!

2441
03:08:47,290 --> 03:08:48,670
Oh, everything is aligning here.

2442
03:08:49,610 --> 03:08:50,050
It's wonderful.

2443
03:08:52,110 --> 03:08:52,930
We got good damage.

2444
03:08:53,790 --> 03:08:54,310
We got health.

2445
03:08:55,570 --> 03:08:56,590
What am I looking for now?

2446
03:08:58,610 --> 03:08:59,390
No actives.

2447
03:09:00,290 --> 03:09:03,450
I guess more tear damage and, you know, just straight up stats.

2448
03:09:04,190 --> 03:09:05,930
Because that's gonna boost my guys.

2449
03:09:08,990 --> 03:09:10,190
Not boosting the boys.

2450
03:09:14,090 --> 03:09:14,890
Dodge it.

2451
03:09:21,260 --> 03:09:21,900
Oh, man.

2452
03:09:27,160 --> 03:09:27,560
Okay.

2453
03:09:28,240 --> 03:09:30,980
If these guys were the ones that jumped on top of me, I would have been dead here.

2454
03:09:33,900 --> 03:09:35,300
I'm not gonna take the chance on that.

2455
03:09:43,960 --> 03:09:45,580
You hurt me, I take health back.

2456
03:09:52,980 --> 03:09:54,040
Ah, I'm not gonna go in there.

2457
03:09:54,320 --> 03:09:55,200
Even with one coin.

2458
03:10:03,920 --> 03:10:04,780
Weird room.

2459
03:10:06,100 --> 03:10:06,320
Okay, fine.

2460
03:10:08,320 --> 03:10:08,800
Hey, okay!

2461
03:10:08,980 --> 03:10:09,980
Nice to be winning here.

2462
03:10:29,020 --> 03:10:29,660
Come on, then.

2463
03:10:37,710 --> 03:10:38,410
Steam sale.

2464
03:10:38,950 --> 03:10:41,850
Wait, what is that last guy I have with me?

2465
03:10:43,450 --> 03:10:44,150
Ghost baby.

2466
03:10:50,200 --> 03:10:51,580
Wait, we have two?

2467
03:10:52,040 --> 03:10:53,480
One is from when I start.

2468
03:10:54,240 --> 03:10:55,540
Then we got another one from here.

2469
03:10:56,580 --> 03:10:57,360
What's the last one?

2470
03:11:02,720 --> 03:11:03,840
What is doing that?

2471
03:11:09,340 --> 03:11:10,620
I... I don't know.

2472
03:11:12,400 --> 03:11:15,420
One of these is a... a stowaway.

2473
03:11:16,880 --> 03:11:18,200
I don't know where you're coming from.

2474
03:11:22,060 --> 03:11:22,500
Weird.

2475
03:11:24,820 --> 03:11:26,920
Maybe it's something that happens on this character when...

2476
03:11:28,240 --> 03:11:29,760
when you just keep going on, you know?

2477
03:11:30,360 --> 03:11:31,180
You get more followers.

2478
03:11:32,320 --> 03:11:34,140
Maybe on a certain floor you get more followers.

2479
03:11:35,160 --> 03:11:35,840
Dude, how is this happening?

2480
03:11:38,360 --> 03:11:39,240
Kill him.

2481
03:11:53,930 --> 03:11:55,290
I may actually just die right now.

2482
03:12:04,460 --> 03:12:06,020
Okay, at least they die fast.

2483
03:12:10,120 --> 03:12:10,620
At least I'm healing.

2484
03:12:24,380 --> 03:12:24,900
I'm done.

2485
03:12:25,500 --> 03:12:25,900
Rage quit!

2486
03:12:26,800 --> 03:12:27,620
Fuck this, man.

2487
03:12:29,580 --> 03:12:31,280
My brain is mush at this point.

2488
03:12:31,400 --> 03:12:32,480
I can't even play properly.

2489
03:12:36,240 --> 03:12:39,360
Oh, Jesus Christ.

2490
03:12:41,500 --> 03:12:43,460
How is this game just getting harder and harder somehow?

2491
03:12:44,860 --> 03:12:45,560
I don't understand.

2492
03:12:47,300 --> 03:12:48,720
It's either that or I'm getting worse.

2493
03:12:49,700 --> 03:12:50,140
Maybe both.

2494
03:12:56,480 --> 03:12:57,640
Oh, I forgot about Bethany.

2495
03:12:57,760 --> 03:12:58,100
That's true.

2496
03:12:59,260 --> 03:13:01,090
Next time, I'm gonna write it down.

2497
03:13:01,090 --> 03:13:04,070
Uh, remember Bethany?

2498
03:13:05,990 --> 03:13:06,790
She's calling.

2499
03:13:09,880 --> 03:13:10,460
There we go.

2500
03:13:10,640 --> 03:13:11,500
I wrote it down.

2501
03:13:14,290 --> 03:13:15,950
Killing Hush on first attempt is huge, though.

2502
03:13:16,130 --> 03:13:16,750
Right, I did that.

2503
03:13:17,030 --> 03:13:17,850
I totally forgot.

2504
03:13:18,710 --> 03:13:22,710
My victory was overshadowed by a massive chain of failures.

